{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","blocks":{"quiz":{"type":"custom-liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div class=\"eje-quiz\" id=\"eje-quiz-root\">\n  <div class=\"eje-quiz__intro\" data-quiz-step=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"eje-quiz__kicker\">Diagnóstico gratis · 4 preguntas · Sin registro</p>\n    <h1 class=\"eje-quiz__title\">Descubre qué necesitas en 2 minutos</h1>\n    <p class=\"eje-quiz__sub\">Responde 4 preguntas y te recomendamos un producto concreto, con la razón de por qué.</p>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--primary\" data-quiz-start>Empezar</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <form class=\"eje-quiz__form\" data-quiz-step=\"form\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"eje-quiz__progress\">\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__progress-bar\" data-quiz-progress-bar></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"eje-quiz__step-count\"><span data-quiz-step-current>1</span> de <span data-quiz-step-total>4</span></p>\n\n    <fieldset class=\"eje-quiz__question\" data-question=\"contexto\">\n      <legend>¿Cuándo aparece la molestia?</legend>\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__options\">\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"contexto\" value=\"oficina\" required>\n          <span>Trabajando en el escritorio</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"contexto\" value=\"entrenamiento\">\n          <span>Después de entrenar o hacer deporte</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"contexto\" value=\"ambos\">\n          <span>En ambos momentos</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n\n    <fieldset class=\"eje-quiz__question\" data-question=\"zona\" hidden>\n      <legend>¿En qué zona la sientes más?</legend>\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__options\">\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"zona\" value=\"cuello_hombros\" required>\n          <span>Cuello y hombros</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"zona\" value=\"espalda_baja\">\n          <span>Espalda baja</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"zona\" value=\"piernas\">\n          <span>Piernas / articulaciones</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"zona\" value=\"general\">\n          <span>En varias zonas</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n\n    <fieldset class=\"eje-quiz__question\" data-question=\"intensidad\" hidden>\n      <legend>¿Qué tan seguido?</legend>\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__options\">\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"intensidad\" value=\"ocasional\" required>\n          <span>De vez en cuando</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"intensidad\" value=\"frecuente\">\n          <span>Varias veces por semana</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"intensidad\" value=\"diario\">\n          <span>Todos los días</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n\n    <fieldset class=\"eje-quiz__question\" data-question=\"objetivo\" hidden>\n      <legend>¿Qué buscas principalmente?</legend>\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__options\">\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"objetivo\" value=\"prevenir\" required>\n          <span>Prevenir molestias</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"objetivo\" value=\"aliviar\">\n          <span>Aliviar una molestia que ya tengo</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"eje-quiz__option\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"objetivo\" value=\"recuperar\">\n          <span>Recuperarme mejor después de entrenar</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n\n    <div class=\"eje-quiz__nav\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--ghost\" data-quiz-back hidden>Atrás</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--primary\" data-quiz-next>Siguiente</button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n\n  <div class=\"eje-quiz__result\" data-quiz-step=\"result\" hidden>\n    <p class=\"eje-quiz__kicker\" data-result-kicker>Tu recomendación</p>\n    <h2 class=\"eje-quiz__result-title\" data-result-title></h2>\n    <p class=\"eje-quiz__result-desc\" data-result-desc></p>\n\n    <div class=\"eje-quiz__product-card\" data-result-product hidden>\n      <img data-result-product-image alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"eje-quiz__product-info\">\n        <p class=\"eje-quiz__product-label\">Recomendado para ti</p>\n        <h3 data-result-product-title></h3>\n        <p data-result-product-price></p>\n        <p class=\"eje-quiz__includes\">Incluye guía de uso: cómo, cuándo y dónde usarlo.</p>\n        <div class=\"eje-quiz__result-ctas\">\n          <a class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--primary\" data-result-add href=\"#\">Agregar al carrito</a>\n          <a class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--ghost\" data-result-product-link href=\"#\">Ver detalle</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eje-quiz__product-card eje-quiz__product-card--empty\" data-result-empty hidden>\n      <p>No encontramos una recomendación exacta para tu perfil. Revisa el catálogo o escríbenos y te ayudamos a elegir.</p>\n      <a class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--primary\" href=\"/collections/all\">Ver productos</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"eje-quiz__btn eje-quiz__btn--ghost\" data-quiz-restart>Repetir diagnóstico</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% comment %}\n  =============================================================================\n  MAPEO DE RESULTADOS -> PRODUCTOS (EDITABLE)\n  =============================================================================\n  Este bloque define qué producto se recomienda según las respuestas del quiz.\n  Hoy solo existe un producto placeholder en la tienda, así que TODOS los\n  resultados apuntan a él. Cuando existan productos reales, edita el objeto\n  RESULT_MAP más abajo en el <script> (busca \"RESULT_MAP\") y reemplaza el\n  \"handle\" de cada resultado por el handle real del producto en Shopify.\n\n  También puedes editar esto sin tocar código: cambia el \"handle\" en\n  Shopify Admin > Contenido > Metacampos, o simplemente pide que se actualice\n  este archivo (blocks/custom-liquid via templates/page.diagnostico.json)\n  la próxima vez que se agreguen productos reales.\n  =============================================================================\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% liquid\n  assign handle_postura = 'corrector-de-postura-ajustable'\n  assign product_postura = all_products[handle_postura]\n\n  assign handle_lumbar = 'soporte-lumbar-ajustable'\n  assign product_lumbar = all_products[handle_lumbar]\n\n  assign handle_kit = 'kit-setup-correcto'\n  assign product_kit = all_products[handle_kit]\n\n  assign handle_compresion = 'banda-de-compresion-para-piernas'\n  assign product_compresion = all_products[handle_compresion]\n\n  assign handle_rodillo = 'rodillo-de-espuma-texturizado'\n  assign product_rodillo = all_products[handle_rodillo]\n%}\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    \"use strict\";\n\n    /* =========================================================================\n       RESULT_MAP — mapeo editable de diagnóstico -> producto recomendado.\n       Cada key es un \"resultado\" posible (combinación de contexto + zona).\n       \"handle\" = handle del producto en Shopify (URL: /products/<handle>).\n       Mientras no haya productos reales, todos usan el mismo placeholder.\n       ========================================================================= */\n    var RESULT_MAP = {\n      oficina_cuello_hombros: {\n        title: \"Corrector de Postura Ajustable\",\n        desc: \"Tu molestia aparece en el escritorio y se concentra en cuello y hombros. Parte con un recordatorio de postura y pausas de movilidad.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_postura }}\"\n      },\n      oficina_espalda_baja: {\n        title: \"Soporte Lumbar Ajustable\",\n        desc: \"Pasas muchas horas sentado y lo sientes en la espalda baja. Lo primero es darle apoyo a esa zona en tu silla.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_lumbar }}\"\n      },\n      oficina_default: {\n        title: \"Kit Setup Correcto\",\n        desc: \"Tu molestia está ligada al trabajo de escritorio. El Kit Setup Correcto (soporte lumbar + reposapiés) es el mejor punto de partida.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_kit }}\"\n      },\n      entrenamiento_piernas: {\n        title: \"Banda de Compresión para Piernas\",\n        desc: \"Después de entrenar lo sientes sobre todo en las piernas. La compresión es un buen complemento para tu recuperación.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_compresion }}\"\n      },\n      entrenamiento_default: {\n        title: \"Rodillo de Espuma Texturizado\",\n        desc: \"Entrenas seguido y quieres recuperarte mejor. Un rodillo para automasaje es la base de cualquier rutina post-entreno.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_rodillo }}\"\n      },\n      ambos_default: {\n        title: \"Kit Setup Correcto\",\n        desc: \"Tu día combina horas sentado y entrenamiento. Empieza por el escritorio con el Kit Setup Correcto; después puedes sumar recuperación.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_kit }}\"\n      },\n      fallback: {\n        title: \"Kit Setup Correcto\",\n        desc: \"Según tus respuestas, el Kit Setup Correcto es el punto de partida más seguro.\",\n        handle: \"{{ handle_kit }}\"\n      }\n    };\n\n    /* Datos de productos disponibles hoy, inyectados desde Liquid.\n       Cuando agregues productos reales, esto se resuelve automáticamente\n       siempre que el \"handle\" en RESULT_MAP exista en la tienda. */\n    var PRODUCTS = {\n      _placeholder_never_used: true\n      {% if product_postura %}\n      ,\"{{ handle_postura }}\": {\n        title: {{ product_postura.title | default: handle_postura | json }},\n        price: {{ product_postura.price | default: 0 | money | json }},\n        image: {% if product_postura.images.size > 0 %}{{ product_postura.images.first | image_url: width: 600 | json }}{% else %}\"\"{% endif %},\n        variant: {{ product_postura.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},\n        url: {% if product_postura.url != blank %}{{ product_postura.url | json }}{% else %}{{ '/products/' | append: handle_postura | json }}{% endif %}\n      }\n      {% endif %}\n      {% if product_lumbar %}\n      ,\"{{ handle_lumbar }}\": {\n        title: {{ product_lumbar.title | default: handle_lumbar | json }},\n        price: {{ product_lumbar.price | default: 0 | money | json }},\n        image: {% if product_lumbar.images.size > 0 %}{{ product_lumbar.images.first | image_url: width: 600 | json }}{% else %}\"\"{% endif %},\n        variant: {{ product_lumbar.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},\n        url: {% if product_lumbar.url != blank %}{{ product_lumbar.url | json }}{% else %}{{ '/products/' | append: handle_lumbar | json }}{% endif %}\n      }\n      {% endif %}\n      {% if product_kit %}\n      ,\"{{ handle_kit }}\": {\n        title: {{ product_kit.title | default: handle_kit | json }},\n        price: {{ product_kit.price | default: 0 | money | json }},\n        image: {% if product_kit.images.size > 0 %}{{ product_kit.images.first | image_url: width: 600 | json }}{% else %}\"\"{% endif %},\n        variant: {{ product_kit.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},\n        url: {% if product_kit.url != blank %}{{ product_kit.url | json }}{% else %}{{ '/products/' | append: handle_kit | json }}{% endif %}\n      }\n      {% endif %}\n      {% if product_compresion %}\n      ,\"{{ handle_compresion }}\": {\n        title: {{ product_compresion.title | default: handle_compresion | json }},\n        price: {{ product_compresion.price | default: 0 | money | json }},\n        image: {% if product_compresion.images.size > 0 %}{{ product_compresion.images.first | image_url: width: 600 | json }}{% else %}\"\"{% endif %},\n        variant: {{ product_compresion.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},\n        url: {% if product_compresion.url != blank %}{{ product_compresion.url | json }}{% else %}{{ '/products/' | append: handle_compresion | json }}{% endif %}\n      }\n      {% endif %}\n      {% if product_rodillo %}\n      ,\"{{ handle_rodillo }}\": {\n        title: {{ product_rodillo.title | default: handle_rodillo | json }},\n        price: {{ product_rodillo.price | default: 0 | money | json }},\n        image: {% if product_rodillo.images.size > 0 %}{{ product_rodillo.images.first | image_url: width: 600 | json }}{% else %}\"\"{% endif %},\n        variant: {{ product_rodillo.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | json }},\n        url: {% if product_rodillo.url != blank %}{{ product_rodillo.url | json }}{% else %}{{ '/products/' | append: handle_rodillo | json }}{% endif %}\n      }\n      {% endif %}\n    };\n\n    var root = document.getElementById(\"eje-quiz-root\");\n    if (!root) return;\n\n    var steps = {\n      intro: root.querySelector('[data-quiz-step=\"intro\"]'),\n      form: root.querySelector('[data-quiz-step=\"form\"]'),\n      result: root.querySelector('[data-quiz-step=\"result\"]')\n    };\n\n    var questions = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll(\".eje-quiz__question\"));\n    var currentIndex = 0;\n    var answers = {};\n\n    var progressBar = root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-progress-bar]\");\n    var stepCurrentEl = root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-step-current]\");\n    var stepTotalEl = root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-step-total]\");\n    stepTotalEl.textContent = questions.length;\n\n    function showStep(name) {\n      Object.keys(steps).forEach(function (key) {\n        steps[key].hidden = key !== name;\n      });\n    }\n\n    function updateProgress() {\n      var pct = ((currentIndex) / questions.length) * 100;\n      progressBar.style.width = pct + \"%\";\n      stepCurrentEl.textContent = Math.min(currentIndex + 1, questions.length);\n    }\n\n    function showQuestion(index) {\n      questions.forEach(function (q, i) {\n        q.hidden = i !== index;\n      });\n      var backBtn = root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-back]\");\n      backBtn.hidden = index === 0;\n      root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-next]\").textContent = index === questions.length - 1 ? \"Ver mi resultado\" : \"Siguiente\";\n      updateProgress();\n    }\n\n    /* Al elegir una opción avanzamos solos (menos clics); \"Siguiente\" sigue disponible. */\n    questions.forEach(function (q, i) {\n      q.addEventListener(\"change\", function () {\n        if (i !== currentIndex || i === questions.length - 1) return;\n        setTimeout(function () { root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-next]\").click(); }, 220);\n      });\n    });\n\n    root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-start]\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      showStep(\"form\");\n      showQuestion(0);\n    });\n\n    root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-next]\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var currentQuestion = questions[currentIndex];\n      var checked = currentQuestion.querySelector('input[type=\"radio\"]:checked');\n      if (!checked) {\n        currentQuestion.reportValidity ? currentQuestion.querySelector(\"input\").reportValidity() : null;\n        return;\n      }\n      answers[currentQuestion.dataset.question] = checked.value;\n\n      if (currentIndex < questions.length - 1) {\n        currentIndex++;\n        showQuestion(currentIndex);\n      } else {\n        showResult();\n      }\n    });\n\n    root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-back]\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      if (currentIndex > 0) {\n        currentIndex--;\n        showQuestion(currentIndex);\n      }\n    });\n\n    root.querySelector(\"[data-quiz-restart]\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      currentIndex = 0;\n      answers = {};\n      questions.forEach(function (q) {\n        var inputs = q.querySelectorAll('input[type=\"radio\"]');\n        inputs.forEach(function (i) { i.checked = false; });\n      });\n      showQuestion(0);\n      showStep(\"intro\");\n    });\n\n    function resolveResultKey() {\n      var contexto = answers.contexto;\n      var zona = answers.zona;\n\n      var specificKey = contexto + \"_\" + zona;\n      if (RESULT_MAP[specificKey]) return specificKey;\n\n      var defaultKey = contexto + \"_default\";\n      if (RESULT_MAP[defaultKey]) return defaultKey;\n\n      return \"fallback\";\n    }\n\n    function showResult() {\n      var key = resolveResultKey();\n      var result = RESULT_MAP[key] || RESULT_MAP.fallback;\n      var product = PRODUCTS[result.handle];\n\n      /* Un producto solo se considera \"real\" y listo para mostrar si tiene\n         titulo y precio validos. El placeholder actual no tiene estos datos\n         completos en Shopify, asi que mostramos el estado vacio en su lugar.\n         Cuando agregues productos reales con titulo/precio, esto se activa\n         automaticamente. */\n      var hasRealProductData = product && product.title && product.price && product.price !== \"$0\";\n\n      root.querySelector(\"[data-result-title]\").textContent = result.title;\n      root.querySelector(\"[data-result-desc]\").textContent = result.desc;\n\n      var productCard = root.querySelector(\"[data-result-product]\");\n      var emptyCard = root.querySelector(\"[data-result-empty]\");\n\n      if (hasRealProductData) {\n        productCard.hidden = false;\n        emptyCard.hidden = true;\n        var img = root.querySelector(\"[data-result-product-image]\");\n        img.hidden = !product.image;\n        if (product.image) { img.src = product.image; img.alt = product.title; }\n        root.querySelector(\"[data-result-product-title]\").textContent = product.title;\n        root.querySelector(\"[data-result-product-price]\").textContent = product.price;\n        root.querySelector(\"[data-result-product-link]\").href = product.url;\n        var add = root.querySelector(\"[data-result-add]\");\n        add.hidden = !product.variant;\n        if (product.variant) add.href = \"/cart/add?id=\" + product.variant + \"&quantity=1\";\n      } else {\n        productCard.hidden = true;\n        emptyCard.hidden = false;\n      }\n\n      showStep(\"result\");\n    }\n  })();\n</script>\n\n<style>\n  .eje-quiz {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 72px 20px 88px;\n    font-family: var(--font-body--family, inherit);\n    color: var(--color-foreground, #161512);\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__kicker {\n    font-family: var(--font-accent--family, inherit);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #b6462b;\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__title {\n    font-family: var(--font-heading--family, inherit);\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);\n    text-wrap: balance;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__sub {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #57554c;\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__btn {\n    min-height: 48px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 14px 28px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 0;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__btn:hover {\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__btn--primary {\n    background: #b6462b;\n    color: #f0eee9;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__btn--ghost {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #161512;\n    border: 1px solid #d6d2c6;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__progress {\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #e4dfd3;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__progress-bar {\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #b6462b;\n    transition: width 0.25s ease;\n    width: 0%;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__step-count {\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    color: #57554c;\n    margin: 0 0 32px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__question legend {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    font-family: var(--font-heading--family, inherit);\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__options {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__option {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    border: 1px solid #d6d2c6;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #f8f6f2;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__option:has(input:checked) {\n    border-color: #b6462b;\n    background: rgba(182, 70, 43, 0.06);\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__option input {\n    accent-color: #b6462b;\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__nav {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__nav .eje-quiz__btn--primary {\n    margin-left: auto;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__result-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-heading--family, inherit);\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 32px);\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__result-desc {\n    color: #57554c;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0 0 32px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-card {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #d6d2c6;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-card img {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 120px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-label {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    color: #b6462b;\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-info h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-info p[data-result-product-price] {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    color: #57554c;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__product-card--empty {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__includes {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: #57554c;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz__result-ctas {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .eje-quiz [hidden] {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .eje-quiz {\n      padding: 32px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .eje-quiz__product-card {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .eje-quiz__product-card img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 200px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n"}}},"block_order":["quiz"],"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":0,"background_color":"#f0eee9","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}}},"order":["main"]}